  "description": "The meme is designed to resonate with members of the Buddhist community, who are the target audience. The visual of Buddhist monks and the text 'how dare people make fun of our peaceful religion' are intended to evoke a sense of solidarity and moral outrage among Buddhists, framing criticism of their faith as an affront to their sacred and peaceful religion. This targets the community by invoking their religious identity and the stereotype of Buddhism as peaceful, aiming to unify them against perceived external mockery.",
